    "speculation": "Skip a sampler snapshot only when maximum possible rollback cannot require a context restore; FULL and insufficient RS capacity retain snapshots.",
    "sampler_clone": "Own returned grammar/reasoning/chain handles during construction; reserve chain child vector once and release completed child clones on failure.",
    "windows_exception_contract": "C++ clone, accept and chain-add APIs explicitly permit exceptions; C prototypes and exported names remain unchanged.",
    "moe_binding": "Publish tensor address only after owning vector and lookup map succeed; roll back partial binding while preserving existing regions.",
    "raw_generation": "Do not retain an unused second full response for token context in raw mode.",
    "metadata": "Cached voice slices have independent ownership on store and return.",
    "tool_text": "Bulk text escaping with one exact reservation; same Unicode, invalid-UTF-8 replacement and control-character behavior.",
    "tool_numbers": "Preserve int64 decimal literals exactly, avoid out-of-range float-to-int casts, and use existing string fallback for NaN/Inf."
